# Home landing

Compose in `HomePageView.tsx`. Thin route: `src/app/(shop)/page.tsx` → `HomePageView`.

## Section order

1. Hero  
2. Why Swiss Arabian  
3. Shop by gender  
4. New launches  
5. Best sellers  
6. Collections  
7. House band (`HouseBandSection` — radial + gold frame)  
8. Trending  
9. Shaghaf  
10. Reviews  
11. Our Story (`#our-story` + `StoryArtPanel` seal)  
12. Newsletter  

Shell chrome (announcement, header, footer, mobile nav) lives in `StorefrontShell` — not in home features.

## Assets & data

- Images: `public/assets/home/` — register paths in `constants/homeAssets.ts`
- Static copy/products: `data/homeContent.ts`
- Shared product tile: `ProductCard` + Zustand cart add

## Gradients / utilities (`globals.css`)

- `.sa-grad-house` — tiles (linear)
- `.sa-grad-house-band` — house band (radial)
- `.sa-grad-story-art` — Our Story seal panel
- `.sa-grad-shaghaf`, `.sa-grad-tile`, `.sa-grad-bento`, `.sa-art-fade` — as named

## Do not

- Fake successful API responses when endpoints are missing
- Put domain business logic in `src/components/ui/`
- Reorder sections without an explicit product/design request
